IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0013.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY SHP0013C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 F-AM               PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM PRICE-PARCEL
    DISPLAY "F-AM=" F-AM
    STOP RUN.
PRICE-PARCEL.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> LIGHT PARCEL
        WHEN PW-KG <= 2
            MOVE 7 TO F-AM
        *> MEDIUM PARCEL
        WHEN PW-KG <= 10
            MOVE 12 TO F-AM
        WHEN OTHER
            COMPUTE F-AM ROUNDED = PW-KG * 1.50
    END-EVALUATE.
